{"page":{"use":"page/basic","data":{"title":"Larkspur Supply Co. opens the region's first gear library","site":"Larkspur Supply Co.","description":"Members can borrow tents, stoves, and snowshoes for free, starting 1 November 2026.","heading":"Larkspur Supply Co. opens the region's first gear library"},"slots":{"main":[
{"use":"content/prose","key":"intro","data":{"html":"<p>For immediate release. Port Wren, 14 October 2026.</p><p><strong>Members can borrow tents, stoves, and snowshoes for free, starting 1 November 2026.</strong></p><p>Port Wren — Larkspur Supply Co. will open a gear library on 1 November 2026. Members can borrow up to three items for a week at no cost. The library starts with 240 items donated by members and repaired in the co-op's workshop.</p>"}},
{"use":"content/quote","key":"quote","data":{"quote":"Most gear spends its life in a closet. A library puts it back on the trail.","author":"Priya Raman, general manager"}},
{"use":"content/prose","key":"details","data":{"html":"<p>The library will be open during store hours at 214 Alder Street.</p><p><strong>About Larkspur Supply Co.:</strong> Founded in 1987, the cooperative is owned by 9,400 members and sells, rents, and repairs outdoor equipment.</p><p><strong>Media contact:</strong> Sam Whitlock, press@larkspur.coop, (360) 555-0177.</p>"}}
]}}}

